### 1. Register a new Business
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/business/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Demo Appointment Business",
  "subdomain": "demo_test",
  "ownerFirstName": "Ahmet",
  "ownerLastName": "Yılmaz",
  "email": "ahmet@demo-appointment.com",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "contactPhone": "05551234567"
}

###

### 2. Login as Business (to get JWT Token)
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/business/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmet@demo-appointment.com",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

> {%
    // Rider için token'ı ve businessId'yi yakala
    client.global.set("authToken", response.body.data.token);
    client.global.set("businessId", response.body.data.business.id);
%}

###

### 3. Create a Single Employee
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..hp-B7ZAqM4oPS-BojwVLnfoOqdG0t1DsNSc4S41iJZg

{
  "firstName": "Mehmet",
  "lastName": "Demir",
  "jobTitle": "Eğitmen",
  "jobDescription": "Robotik ve Kodlama Eğitmeni"
}

###

### 4. Bulk Create Employees
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/employees/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..6EfOAhn8BwV7qx9VQfcG2eiKq-nApPlvWTikMocNlro
[
  {
    "firstName": "Ayşe",
    "lastName": "Kaya",
    "jobTitle": "Satış Yöneticisi",
    "jobDescription": "Veli iletişimi ve satış"
  },
  {
    "firstName": "Ali",
    "lastName": "Can",
    "jobTitle": "Muhasebe",
    "jobDescription": "Finans işlemleri"
  }
]

###

