### 6. Register a new User (Customer) for the Business
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Veli",
  "lastName": "Müşteri",
  "email": "veli@example.com",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "phoneNumber": "05559998877"
}

###

### 7. Login as User (Customer)
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "veli@example.com",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("userAuthToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

###

### 8. Create a Service (Workshop / Class) - Business Auth Required
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/services
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..OibHul1Jmmv1_s3wEusB7Snry3twPfHVFInNi78uvMk

{
  "name": "Psikoloji İlk Görüşme (Online)",
  "description": "Tanışma ve değerlendirme seansı",
  "durationInMinutes": 30,
  "priceType": 4, 
  "price": null,
  "isOnline": true
}

###

### 9. Get All Services for Logged-in Business
GET http://localhost:5299/api/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 10. Set Working Hours for an Employee
# Not: Yukarıdaki "5. Get All Employees" isteğini çalıştırıp, aldığınız bir "id" değerini aşağıdaki URL'ye yapıştırın.
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/employees/BURAYA_EMPLOYEE_ID_GELECEK/working-hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

[
  {
    "dayOfWeek": 1,
    "isDayOff": false,
    "startTime": "09:00:00",
    "endTime": "18:00:00",
    "breakStartTime": "12:00:00",
    "breakEndTime": "13:00:00"
  },
  {
    "dayOfWeek": 2,
    "isDayOff": false,
    "startTime": "09:00:00",
    "endTime": "18:00:00",
    "breakStartTime": null,
    "breakEndTime": null
  },
  {
    "dayOfWeek": 0,
    "isDayOff": true,
    "startTime": "00:00:00",
    "endTime": "00:00:00",
    "breakStartTime": null,
    "breakEndTime": null
  }
]

###

### 11. Get Working Hours of an Employee
GET http://localhost:5299/api/v1/employees/BURAYA_EMPLOYEE_ID_GELECEK/working-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 12. Create an Appointment as a User (Customer)
# Not: Yukarıdaki 5'ten EmployeeId ve 9'dan ServiceId alarak yapıştırınız. İşlem User (Müşteri) olarak yapılır.
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._aZnjwqE4lAQ3dzQ5mXQnujCDG3woqRYaKf0TacnMBo

{
  "businessId": "9671a820-f00d-462f-9821-3fec3f03b090",
  "employeeId": "BURAYA_EMPLOYEE_ID_GELECEK",
  "serviceId": "BURAYA_SERVICE_ID_GELECEK",
  "startTimeUtc": "2026-03-30T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### 13. Get My Appointments (As User)
GET http://localhost:5299/api/v1/appointments/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._aZnjwqE4lAQ3dzQ5mXQnujCDG3woqRYaKf0TacnMBo

###

### 14. Get Business Appointments (As Business)
GET http://localhost:5299/api/v1/appointments/business
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..6EfOAhn8BwV7qx9VQfcG2eiKq-nApPlvWTikMocNlro

###

### 15. Cancel Appointment
DELETE http://localhost:5299/api/v1/appointments/BURAYA_APPOINTMENT_ID_GELECEK
Authorization: Bearer {{userAuthToken}}

###

### 16. Refresh Business Token
# Not: Login adımından dönen 'refreshToken' değerini yapıştırın.
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/business/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "BURAYA_REFRESH_TOKEN_GELECEK"
}

###

### 17. Logout Business
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/business/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 18. Refresh User Token
# Not: Login adımından dönen 'refreshToken' değerini yapıştırın.
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/user/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "BURAYA_REFRESH_TOKEN_GELECEK"
}

###

### 19. Logout User
POST http://localhost:5299/api/v1/user/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{userAuthToken}}

###
